                          ? 'font-semibold text-brand-700'
                          : 'text-ink-700',
                    ]}
                  >
                    {t.view === null ? 'Nothing to do' : on ? 'Showing' : 'Show these'}
                  </span>
                </span>
              </>
            )

            // Green is not a link. There is no filtered view behind it because
            // there is nothing on the other side to act on, and a tap that lands
            // on a list he does not need to read is a tap this page wasted.
            return t.view === null ? (
