    {
      fleetExposure.counted > 0 && (
        <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-800 px-4 py-4 text-white sm:px-5">
          {/*
            BRAND GREEN, AND NOT A STATUS COLOUR, ON PURPOSE.

            Red, amber and grey are spoken for on this page — overdue, due soon,
            no date — and every one of them is a claim about where an item
            STANDS. This figure is not a standing. It is what the items above it
            could cost, and painting it red would make a ceiling read as a bill
            that has arrived. Brand-800 is the same reasoning the nav pill is
